equest":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105253","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105253","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105253.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105253.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-11T14:56:31Z"},"body":"Replaces NavigationServer3D `Point` struct with `Vector3` and renames points to vertices.\r\n\r\n3D version of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105252\r\n\r\nMakes code simpler and more readable. Also renames the points to vertices as vertices have a clear meaning in context of navmesh geometry while points are just something.\r\n\r\nWe have no real need to keep the (edge)key of the Point struct as it can be constructed on demand. It is only needed at the edge merge step when the map is build, never after, so a waste to keep it around forever. That reduces the Point to just the `pos` which is the global position on the navigation map, aka a simple Vector3 can do that better.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"h